# Atlantysm — root environment
#
# Read ONLY by scripts/generatePromoLinks.ts. The contracts and the client have their own:
#   packages/contracts/.env   deploy key + ERC-6551 identity inputs
#   packages/client/.env      VITE_* build-time values
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is gitignored. `.env.example` is not — keep real keys out of this file.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The funded Sepolia wallet the promo burners are paid from. It can be the same key as the
# contracts deployer; the script only ever sends plain transfers from it.
#
# 50 wallets x 0.02 ETH = 1.0 ETH plus gas. The script checks the balance before sending anything,
# so a wallet that is short fails on transfer 0 rather than on transfer 38.
MASTER_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sepolia RPC. Defaults to https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com, which is fine for 50
# transfers. A dedicated key is worth it if you are re-running the script repeatedly.
#
# Safe to set here, unlike in packages/contracts/.env: `mud deploy` runs with that package as its
# working directory and never reads this file, so it cannot hijack a local deploy.
#
# The script asks the endpoint for its chain id and refuses to run unless it answers 11155111 —
# pointing this at mainnet by accident would otherwise spend 1 ETH of real money.
# RPC_URL=https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/<YOUR_KEY>
